  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "We use the BODMAS rule to solve the equation:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nWe apply each option on the given equation:\n\n127 * 13 * 3 * 129 * 41\n\nOption 1) +, =, +, −\n\n__**127 + 13**__ = __**3 + 129**__ - 41\n\n140 = __**132 - 41**__\n\n140 ≠ 91 \n\nOption 2) −, ×, =, −\n\n127 - __**13 × 3**__ = 129 - 41\n\n__**127 -**____** **39__ = __**129 -**____** 41**__\n\n88 = 88\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) ÷, −, =, −\n__**127 ÷ 13**__ - 3 = 129 - 41\n\n__**9.7 -**____** 3**__ = __**129 - 41**__\n\n6.7 ≠ 88\n\nOption 4) −, −, =, +\n127 - 13 - 3 = __**129 + 41\n\n127 -**____** 13 -**____** 3**__ = 170 \n\n111 ≠ 170 \n\nHence **the correct answer is option 2)**",
